ource list."},"381":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-21","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#configure-your-server-step","content":"Configure your mysql connection string and set it before starting any resources."},"382":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-22","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#configure-your-server-step","content":"Certain special characters are reserved or unsupported depending on your connection string.\\\nAvoid using these characters `; , / ? : @ & = + $ #`, and try swapping connection string format."},"383":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-23","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#slow-query-warnings-step","content":"You will receive warnings if a query took a long time to complete, configurable with a convar."},"384":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-24","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#slow-query-warnings-step","content":"Query time may not be entirely accurate."},"385":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-25","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#slow-query-warnings-step","content":"Slow queries may not indicate a database issue (e.g. server hitches)."},"386":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-26","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#slow-query-warnings-step","content":"Slow queries on server startup are not necessarily problematic."},"387":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-27","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#debug-step","content":"Enabling the debug option will print all queries in the server console; you can also use an array to only print from a list of resources instead."},"388":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-28","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#debug-step","content":"You can temporarily modify the resource list with commands."},"389":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql-29","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql#compatibility","content":"You c