"url":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders"},"399":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders-0","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","content":"Placeholders allow for query parameters to be safely executed, preventing common SQL injection methods."},"400":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders-1","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","content":"Parameters can be passed an an array or object (referred to as named parameters)."},"401":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders-2","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","content":"These are distinct from prepared statements which are handled by the MySQL server; you can use `MySQL.prepare` for more optimised and secure queries."},"402":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","type":"page","content":"Using the Debug UI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","OxMySQL"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui"},"403":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-0","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#main-page","content":"Main page"},"404":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-1","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"Resource page"},"405":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-2","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"The debug UI lets you easily see all the queries that have been executed by resources, query response times, and per-resource statistics.\nYou should only enable this during development, or with a small player count - for larger servers, look into builtin MySQL logging."},"406":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-3","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"Before using the UI first you have to make sure you have the `mysql_ui` convar set to true:"},"407":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-4","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"Also make sure that you have `command` or `command.mysql` ace permission access, then you should be able to use the `mysql` command in game."},"408":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-5","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"You *do not* need to have the `mysql_debug` enabled to use the debug ui."},"409":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-6","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#main-page","content":"The main page shows you the resources that ran queries where you can filter them through a search bar, your general data\nalong side a pie chart which shows what resources took the most query time."},"410":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-7","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"The resource page shows you all the queries and their execution time inside a table that the resource previously ran,\nalongside the total amount of the queries, execution time and slow queries for the selected resource."},"411":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-8","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"Columns can be sorted by ascending and descending order, and hovering over a query will display the full query inside a tooltip."},"412":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-9","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"Queries that exceed `mysql_slow_query_warning` (default 150ms) are displayed in orange.\\\nFor demonstation purposes the `mysql_slow_query_warning` convar was set to 5 here."},"413":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","type":"page","content":"Fivemanage","tags":[],"url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage"},"414":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage-0","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","content":"Fivemanage"},"415":{"id":"/docs/